{"meta":{"title":"United States active burning observation archive","retrievedAt":"2026-10-22T21:46:35.430529+00:00","availableThrough":"2025-12-31","dataKind":"observed satellite active-fire detections","measurement":"Daily unique 5 km equal-area grid cells containing a vegetation-fire detection, separately for each sensor. Monthly values sum daily occupied cells (cell-days), not area burned.","grid":{"name":"Spherical cylindrical equal-area, standard parallel 30 degrees","radiusKm":6371,"cellKm":5,"formula":"x=6371*lonRadians*cos(30deg); y=6371*sin(latRadians)/cos(30deg); cell=floor(x/5),floor(y/5)"},"filter":"FIRMS archived science data, type=0 (presumed vegetation fire); all confidence classes retained; within 2025 Census state/DC boundaries. MODIS Terra/Aqua deduplicated together per cell/day. VIIRS uses only Suomi NPP to avoid constellation-size changes.","caveats":["Raw MODIS and VIIRS counts remain sensor-dependent and are not scientifically calibrated by this dataset.","Zero means no retained detections in the supplied archive, not proof of no burning or complete clear-sky observation.","Clouds, swath geometry, confidence, revisit frequency and instrument outages affect detection.","Hotspots include wildfire and agricultural or prescribed burns; satellite type=0 does not separate them.","VIIRS Suomi NPP begins 2012-01-20; prior days are null.","MODIS Terra-only in 2001; Aqua joins during 2002.","First and last source detection dates describe detections, not independently verified observation coverage.","Monthly observedDays means dates with any US archive record for that sensor, not verified clear-sky coverage in the selected region. Exclude partial months from sensor-calibration fits or match available days explicitly."],"sources":[{"sensor":"MODIS","year":2001,"source":"https://firms.modaps.eosdis.nasa.gov/data/country/modis/2001/modis_2001_United_States.csv","totalSourceRows":44941,"vegetationRowsInStates":41816,"firstSourceDetectionDate":"2001-01-01","l